BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td 14 TL (Kiwi Cover Mutual \(KCM\) - Claims handling modernisation) Tj T* (Client brief) Tj T* () Tj T* (Prepared by Hana Te Rangi, Head of Claims. 9 March 2026.) Tj T* (\(Fictitious example document, written for the Gantry example.\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Why now) Tj T* () Tj T* (A member who makes a straightforward home or motor claim waits a median of 12.4 working days) Tj T* (from notification to payment. Members expect five.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Every claim touches four separately operated systems: Policy Data Management on the) Tj T* (mainframe, the CRM System, the Home & Away Financial Application and the document) Tj T* (management system. A handler keys the claim into each of them.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Around 18 percent of claims are re-keyed at least once.) Tj T* (Only two contractors still hold mainframe skills, so the risk grows every year.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The platform was inherited from the 2014 ArchiSurance merger and was never integrated.) Tj T* ET
endstream
