BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td 14 TL (2. What good looks like) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Median notification-to-payment time for standard claims at or below five working days,) Tj T* (  within two quarters of go-live.) Tj T* (- Claim re-key rate below three percent.) Tj T* (- Ninety-five percent of approved claims paid within one working day.) Tj T* (- No increase in the fraud referral rate, and no loss of audit trail, checked at the first) Tj T* (  post-go-live audit.) Tj T* () Tj T* (3. Boundaries) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Policy Data Management stays the system of record for policies and the claims ledger.) Tj T* (- Claims data stays in New Zealand. Everything runs in the Wellington data centre; no cloud) Tj T* (  landing zone is approved for member data yet.) Tj T* (- The CRM System and the Financial Application are extended, not replaced.) Tj T* (- Out of scope: underwriting, pricing and product configuration; broker, partner and mobile) Tj T* (  channels; fraud analytics beyond the existing referral rules.) Tj T* ET
endstream
