BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td 14 TL (4. Timing and money) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Three increments over about nine months: Register and Accept, then Valuate, then Pay.) Tj T* (- The BIBIT payment gateway must go live within its current contract term.) Tj T* (- Delivery is funded from the 2026 operating budget; there is no contingency for a) Tj T* (  separate platform purchase.) Tj T* () Tj T* (5. People) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Sponsor and process owner: Hana Te Rangi, Head of Claims.) Tj T* (- Delivery lead: Priya Natarajan, Solution Architect.) Tj T* (- Treasury \(BIBIT contract\): Anaru Pihema.) Tj T* (- Records Management \(retention rules\): Karen Doyle.) Tj T* (- Privacy Office \(member consent and PIA\): Elena Rossi.) Tj T* () Tj T* (6. What we are asking of the design) Tj T* () Tj T* (One Handle Claim process on shared customer, policy and claim data, so a member reports a) Tj T* (claim once and is paid the day it is approved.) Tj T* ET
